# dev-stack sites configuration (Windows)
# One site per line:  host | docroot | php | kind | aliases(optional, comma separated)
# 'kind' is informational (php|laravel|wp|legacy). '#' starts a comment.
#
# Copied to %USERPROFILE%\.config\devstack\sites.conf by install.ps1, or run:
#   devstack add-site
#
# Example:
# casepilot.test | C:\Sites\CasePilot\public | 8.3 | laravel
# jd-blog.test   | C:\Sites\jd-blog\public   | 8.5 | php
# wptest.test    | C:\Sites\wptest           | 8.5 | wp
# myapp.test     | C:\Sites\myapp            | 8.5 | laravel | www.myapp.test
